{"message":"I can help with all three requests, but I first need to verify your identity before accessing or changing your accounts. Please provide your full name and any 2 of these 4 items: date of birth, email address, phone number, or current address.

Once verified, I’ll check that your Light Blue Account has a $0 balance and no pending transactions, review whether a $15 early-closure fee applies, and confirm your eligibility for a replacement checking account and personal savings account.

For your $25,000 savings goal, the Gold Account currently has a documented 5.5% APY when the balance remains at least $10,000. We’ll also compare eligible checking-account boosts before opening it. If perks are your priority, Bluest Account offers 2.25% APY on checking, 10 free outgoing domestic wires monthly, a dedicated personal banker, up to $50 in monthly ATM rebates, and no foreign ATM withdrawal fees. Please also confirm whether you prefer the Bluest Account for premium perks or another account focused on maximizing the savings APY, and whether you want the $25,000 transferred into the new savings account immediately."}
